    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "columns"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The details"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Two approaches, two philosophies."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "MagicWave chose written fiction. Caresse chose bespoke generation. The promise isn't the same."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p>\n                <h3>Listen first. Decide later.</h3>\n                <p>Before any purchase, you get access to pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish. No sign-up, no account, no email: you hear right away the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels. The demos don't speak your name or use your profile, but they faithfully reflect what you're about to experience.</p>\n                <p>When you start a bespoke session, Caresse builds a scenario from your profile: who you are, what you go by, what you want tonight, the intensity, the atmosphere. The voice names you. The scenario doesn't look like any other, because it was only ever written for this session — and it works just as well solo as it does with a partner.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Audio demos playable without an account (EN · FR · ES)</li>\n                    <li>Anonymous mode without a Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account</li>\n                    <li>Names spoken aloud in the narration</li>\n                    <li>Duration varies with generation; exact length is not a setting</li>\n                    <li>Essentially infinite combinations: genders, practices, accessories, intensity, setting, atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>Native couple and solo modes</li>\n                    <li>No subscription: you pay per session</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card muted"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">MagicWave</p>\n                <h3>An English-language library of romance fiction.</h3>\n                <p>MagicWave offers thousands of full-cast romance audiobooks, written in advance by authors, spanning genres like contemporary romance, fantasy, werewolf and vampire. The app leans into an approach made by and for women. Accessing the full catalog requires a subscription (MagicWave Prime) or a virtual currency (Shells) you top up. The audio then plays as-is: the same narration, the same story, for every listener.</p>\n                <p>A good fit if you're looking for a large catalog of romance fiction to browse, across varied worlds. Less of a fit if you want the voice to call you by name, an experience configured for a couple, or content available in French.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Catalog of thousands of full-cast audiobooks, pre-written</li>\n                    <li>Varied genres: romance, fantasy, werewolf, vampire</li>\n                    <li>Generic narration, identical for every listener</li>\n                    <li>Available in English only</li>\n                    <li>Subscription or virtual currency (Shells) required for the full catalog</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "pricing"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Pricing"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Pay per session vs subscription."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Caresse doesn't charge you for the months you don't use the app. MagicWave offers a 7-day free trial, then a monthly, quarterly or annual subscription, or à la carte Shells packs."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and demos. Personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>MagicWave</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Subscription or Shells</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">7-day free trial, then $4.99–6.99/month or $47.99/year (Prime), or Shells packs from $0.99 to $26.99 depending on the amount.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "MagicWave pricing recorded 17 August 2026 on the US App Store listing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No spin. Here's who each app is best for."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen to real audio demos before paying, no account required</li>\n                    <li>to use the app fully anonymously — no sign-up, ever</li>\n                    <li>the voice to call you and your partner by your actual names</li>\n                    <li>an experience that doesn't look like any other, every single time</li>\n                    <li>to set the exact duration, intensity, practices and atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>to pay only for what you listen to, with no idle subscription</li>\n                    <li>a solo mode as polished as the couple mode</li>\n                    <li>generated sessions in English, French, Spanish and Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose MagicWave if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>a large catalog of full-cast romance fiction, in English</li>\n                    <li>varied worlds: contemporary romance, fantasy, werewolf, vampire</li>\n                    <li>an approach made by and for women</li>\n                    <li>a classic subscription format or a virtual currency to top up</li>\n                    <li>to listen to pre-written stories without configuring every time</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Leaning toward a French-language library instead? See our comparison with <a href=\"/en/vs-melba/\">Melba</a>. Curious about a different AI approach? Compare with <a href=\"/en/vs-inthemoment/\">InTheMoment</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs MagicWave — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I listen to Caresse before paying, without creating an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse offers pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish, playable immediately — no sign-up, no email, no account. You hear the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels before any decision. Demos don't use your name or profile, but they faithfully reflect the experience."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse available in French like MagicWave is in English?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish. MagicWave's catalog is available in English only."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What's the main difference between Caresse and MagicWave?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "MagicWave is a library of full-cast romance audiobooks in English, written by authors and designed for passive, individual listening. Caresse generates a unique scenario every time: your names spoken aloud, intensity, practices and atmosphere configured by you, for solo use or as a couple."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse run on a subscription or pay-per-session?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse is pay-per-session — no mandatory monthly subscription. You pay when you want a new experience, you don't pay for months you don't use it. MagicWave runs on a subscription (MagicWave Prime, monthly, quarterly or annual) or a virtual currency (Shells) you top up."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse offer a couple mode the way MagicWave offers a solo one?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse natively offers both a solo mode and a couple mode. MagicWave is built for individual listening: full-cast audiobooks read to you, not an experience configured for a couple with your names."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse have as large a catalog as MagicWave?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Not in the same sense. MagicWave offers thousands of full-cast audiobooks, written in advance, across varied genres (romance, fantasy, werewolf, vampire). Caresse doesn't offer a catalog to browse: every session is generated on demand from your intimate profile. You never replay the same thing, and you're never waiting on a release schedule."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
